The ONLY paragraph connection decision. Set true when this text belongs to the preceding paragraph in the selected stream, including across pages; it need not complete an unfinished sentence. A figure and its captions before this text do not make it a new body paragraph: on the FIRST main TEXT after such labels, join=true still appends to the preceding-page body cursor. A literal unfinished clause and its completion are ONE paragraph, not a new paragraph merely because a page/image intervened. A new paragraph is false. Decide within this destination, not against physical neighbours or captions. Assets themselves are false. No outgoing flag is submitted.
